        "\n",
        "This section demonstrates typical OptiWell workflows. \n",
        "\n",
        "## Creating a Fluid Model \n",
        "\n",
        "To create a fluid model, click the \"+\" sign to add a new fluid model. In this examplel, we will select \"Black oil\" \n",
        "as the \"Fluid Type\" and \"Correlations\" as the \"PVT Method\" as shown below. \n",
        "\n",
        "The following table presents the PVT data input to create a fluid model. \n",
        "\n",
        "**PVT Data**"
      ],
      "id": "e15d277a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false  \n",
        " \n",
        "import pandas as pd  \n",
        "\n",
        "pvt_props = [\"GOR\", \"Gas gravity\", \"API\", \"Salinity\", \"Watercut\", \"N2\", \"CO2\", \"H2S\"]\n",
        "pvt_vals = [339, 0.727, 24, 1000000, 0.30, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00]\n",
        "\n",
        "pvt_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "  \"Property\": pvt_props, \n",
        "  \"Value\": pvt_vals, \n",
        "\n",
        "}) \n",
        "\n",
        "pvt_df.style.hide(axis=\"index\")\n",
        "\n",
        "pvt_df"
      ],
      "id": "8243826d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "The following is the PVT Modeling Settings options.  "
      ],
      "id": "862a6ec2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false \n",
        "\n",
        " \n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "field = [\"Bubble Point Correlation\", \"Solution GOR\", \"Oil FVF Correlation\", \"Oil Viscosity Correlation\"]  \n",
        "select_option = [\"Standing\", \"Standing\", \"Standing\", \"Beggs-Robinson\"]  \n",
        "\n",
        "model_select_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "  \"Select field\": field, \n",
        "  \"Selected Option\": select_option\n",
        "}) \n",
        "\n",
        "model_select_df.style.hide(axis=\"index\")\n",
        "\n",
        "model_select_df"
      ],
